
# AI Storytelling and Creative Writing Lab

## About
A creative writing web application that helps users
explore story ideas and generate sample story drafts.

## Features
- Enter a story idea
- Select a story genre
- Generate a sample story
- Copy the generated story
- Simple and responsive user interface

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Run
Open index.html in a web browser.

## Project Status
Initial demo version. Live AI integration is a future enhancement.
